# Repository Contract

Read `AGENTS.md` and the nearest scoped `AGENTS.md`; they are canonical. For non-trivial tasks,
load `launchpad-orchestrate` and follow one Playbook.

- Preserve user work and keep changes focused.
- Never reveal or commit secrets, customer data, tokens, or auth links.
- Deploys, pushes, remote migrations, billing/secret changes, and destructive Git require
  explicit user approval.
- Add focused tests, run relevant checks, and inspect the complete diff.
- Commit each verified logical change separately after checks pass; leave unrelated WIP
  unstaged. Do not wait to be asked to commit finished, reviewable work.
